{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move, jump, and progress. Stuck? Try flipping the world. This is all you can do in this peculiar, monochromatic space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516450/extras/d1e65b464848dae4cb3802698dd5b700.poster.avif?t=1762940013\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516450/extras/d1e65b464848dae4cb3802698dd5b700.webm?t=1762940013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516450/extras/d1e65b464848dae4cb3802698dd5b700.mp4?t=1762940013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take You\u00a0Home\u00a0is an indie minimalist 2D platformer game where you navigate by swapping the black and white and inverting gravity to find\u00a0your way forward. Your goal is to chase a mysterious black cat that occasionally appears, to see what unfolds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swap black and white and invert gravity to find your way forward.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >80 (or more) meticulously crafted and distinct levels, woven into a simple yet touching narrative.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only three controls, making it easy to pick up and play.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect items for unexpected surprises?</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3516450?t=1762940013","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3516450?t=1762940013","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516450/d648fba46e78dbfb7959df8975